title: Center Faction Splits
new-page: true
subtitle: The Center faction's disagreements with party policy have grown too severe.
tags: event
view-if: center_dissent >= 60 and not center_leaders_resigned and z_center_split_timer = 0
on-arrival: {!
Q.center_leaders_resigned = 1;
Q.z_center_split_timer = 4;

if (Q.center_strength < 10) {
    Q.workers_z -= 3;
    Q.new_middle_z -= 2;
    Q.rb_strength -= 150;
} else if (Q.center_strength < 25) {
    Q.workers_z -= 4;
    Q.new_middle_z -= 3;
    Q.old_middle_z -= 2;
    Q.rb_strength -= 250;
} else if (Q.center_strength < 40) {
    Q.workers_z -= 5;
    Q.new_middle_z -= 4;
    Q.old_middle_z -= 3;
    Q.rural_z -= 2;
    Q.rb_strength -= 350;
} else if (Q.center_strength < 60) {
    Q.workers_z -= 6;
    Q.new_middle_z -= 6;
    Q.old_middle_z -= 4;
    Q.rural_z -= 3;
    Q.rb_strength -= 450;
} else {
    Q.workers_z -= 8;
    Q.new_middle_z -= 8;
    Q.old_middle_z -= 6;
    Q.rural_z -= 4;
    Q.unemployed_z -= 2;
    Q.rb_strength -= 600;
}

Q.z_relation -= 5;
Q.ddp_relation -= 3;
Q.dvp_relation -= 3;
Q.bvp_relations -= 10;
if (Q.bvp_relations < 0) Q.bvp_relations = 0;

Q.center_strength = Q.center_strength * 0.3;

Q.n_advisors_start = Q.n_advisors;
if (Q.guérard_advisor == 1) Q.n_advisors -= 1;
Q.guérard_advisor = 0;
if (Q.hermes_advisor == 1) Q.n_advisors -= 1;
Q.hermes_advisor = 0;
if (Q.bell_advisor == 1) Q.n_advisors -= 1;
Q.bell_advisor = 0;
if (Q.n_advisors < Q.n_advisors_start) Q.shuffle_leadership_timer = 0;
!}
max-visits: 1

= Center Faction leaders resign

Our policy choices have greatly offended the Center faction. Many of our most experienced parliamentary leaders have resigned, citing the party's drift from the constitutional center. They form a loose <span style="color: #D3C24D;">**Constitutional Catholic Association**</span> — not a full party, but a pressure group that will contest our claim to represent the moderate Catholic electorate.

The BVP views this split with alarm, fearing it undermines the Catholic center's unity.